:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity\">Altar of Fecundity</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity_-_Manufactured_Ingredient_Recipes\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity - Manufactured Ingredient Recipes\">Manufactured Ingredient Recipes</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Taint_of_Shavarath\" title=\"Legendary Taint of Shavarath\">Legendary Taint of Shavarath</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Taint_of_Shavarath\" title=\"Legendary Taint of Shavarath\">Legendary Taint of Shavarath</a>:</b> Green Steel items thirst for pain and suffering. While weapons feed their bloodlust on enemies, accessories and clothing cannot. Wearing multiple items that bear the Legendary Taint of Shavarath creates dangerous imbalances of energy as the items feed more and more upon the wielder. Perhaps there is a way to appease this item...</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Gloves.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Gloves.png/420px-Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Gloves.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"386\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Gloves.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Green_Steel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary Green Steel\">Legendary Green Steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Gloves crafted from cloth woven with threads of green steel.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><b>Legendary Green Steel Weave Gloves</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>100 <a href=\"/page/Item:Codex_Rune\" title=\"Item:Codex Rune\">Codex Runes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Valor\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Valor\">100&#32;Commendations of Valor</a></li></ul>\n<p>Made at the <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity\">Altar of Fecundity</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817215310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.125 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2370/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17148/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4322/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n127.07%  139.281     32 Template:IO\n100.00%  109.609      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  109.609      1 -total\n 95.74%  104.942      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 45.23%   49.578      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 43.79%   47.994      2 Template:I